<section id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow center"><span class="dot"></span> Why people switch</div>
      <h2>Everything a power scrubber should be</h2>
      <p>Engineered so the machine does the work — you just guide it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid reveal-stagger">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="{{ 'extend.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Telescopic handle shown at two extension lengths" loading="lazy" class="card-photo" width="720" height="789">
        <h3>Extends to 51 inches</h3>
        <p>The telescopic aluminum handle adjusts from countertop-short to shower-ceiling-tall — reach every corner without a stool or a stretch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>100% cordless freedom</h3>
        <p>A rechargeable 2200mAh battery delivers up to 120 minutes of run time on a single 3-hour USB-C charge. Clean the whole house, no outlets required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>3 power modes</h3>
        <p>Eco, Standard and Turbo give you 150–350 RPM of adjustable spin power — gentle enough for glass, strong enough for grout.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>IPX7 waterproof</h3>
        <p>Fully sealed motor housing means it's completely safe to use in the shower, at the sink, or hosing it clean afterward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>8 interchangeable heads</h3>
        <p>Flat scrubber, detail brush, bristle head, scouring pad, buffing pad, microfiber pad and sponge pad — click to swap in under 2 seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#04141a" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v10M4.22 4.22l4.24 4.24m7.08 7.08 4.24 4.24M1 12h6m6 0h10M4.22 19.78l4.24-4.24m7.08-7.08 4.24-4.24"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Whisper-quiet motor</h3>
        <p>Runs under 65dB — clean early in the morning or late at night without waking the house.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

